  "2026-07-26T23:47:22.068Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: merge install now records absolute Node and built-CLI paths, passes Git's real %P item path into item drivers, and exposes an exact local-driver audit consumed by health and validate. A packed unrelated consumer merged two real branches with PATH restricted to /usr/bin:/bin; the driver still ran, returned the expected conflict exit, preserved both append-only sides, and produced one decision receipt. Focused driver install/drift tests, strict static gates, and full 6,437-test coverage pass."
  "2026-07-26T23:49:53.145Z","harness:codex","Final local verification: linked PM tests pass; full sandboxed suite passes 376 files and 6,437 tests at exact 100% statements (44,398/44,398), branches (31,515/31,515), functions (9,082/9,082), and lines (43,135/43,135). Lint, zero-duplicate scan, 100% docstring/static quality, SDK surface/import/transport ratchets, docs/skills, secret scan, npm audit, compatibility, packed npx, 88-command package-first dogfood, and Sentry 14-day zero-critical/zero-high gate pass. Live tracker strict validation checked 2,117 items and 2,128 history streams with zero drift, duplicate IDs, config errors, driver drift, or pending receipts. Telemetry successfully flushed to the configured endpoint at 2026-07-26T23:49:30.656Z."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T23:47:22.747Z","harness:codex","A merge fence is only fail-closed when both attribute routing and the clone-local driver command are audited. Absolute executable paths remove shell PATH drift, while exact command comparison detects moved or stale installations before a merge silently falls back."
